#N canvas 120 60 900 560 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_sphere_voice <index> <owner> - one target of [fs_sphere] \, loaded 64 times by [clone]. Inlet: level <0..1> (per sensor frame) | note <midi> | attack <ms> | release <ms>. Shared per sphere (sent by the owning fs_sphere): <owner>-gate \, <owner>-energy \, <owner>-attack \, <owner>-release. Switches its own DSP off while silent \, so unused voices cost almost nothing., f 110;
#X obj 20 110 inlet;
#X obj 20 140 route level note attack release;
#X obj 20 200 fs_smooth 40 600;
#X obj 250 140 r \$2-attack;
#X obj 400 140 r \$2-release;
#X obj 20 250 *;
#X obj 120 220 r \$2-gate;
#X obj 20 330 fs_partials 60;
#X obj 250 290 r \$2-energy;
#X obj 20 400 outlet~;
#X obj 450 290 > 0.0001;
#X obj 450 320 change;
#X obj 450 380 switch~;
